{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"1429","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"候變遷加劇天災 全美去年340萬人流離失所","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">2023-02-14 15:26 世界日報／記者顏伶如／綜合報導</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.ctspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B1.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 80%;\\\" /></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">圖為去年10月侵襲佛州的伊安颶風，造成上千億元損失。圖為靠近海邊的佛州邁爾海灘堡社區，去年9月29日遭到伊安颶風摧毀。(美聯社)</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; border-radius: 0px; height: 1px; margin: 20px 0px; border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\\\" />\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">氣候變遷引發的氣象災害已讓全美社區因此改變，聯邦人口普查局(Census Bureau)今年稍早取得統計顯示，2022年約有340萬國人因為天然災害而被迫離開家園，絕大多數流離失所的民眾是因為颶風而受害，其次則是洪水，野火、龍捲風緊隨其後。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">統計顯示，因為天然災害而逃離家園的美國民眾裡，將近40%在一周之內回到家中，另外12%民眾被撤離家園超過半年。約有16%災民事發之後一直未能回家，未來恐怕永遠無法重回家園。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">人口普查局統計資料來自於今年1月4日至1月16日間的6萬8504份「家庭脈動問卷調查」(Household Pulse Survey)回函。聯邦政府從2020年開始調查天災之後民眾撤離家園之後的動態；人口普查局表示，這份數據為實驗性質，根據抽樣數據做出推斷。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">哥倫比亞大學(Columbia University)薩賓氣候變化法律中心(Sabin Center for Climate Change Law)主任吉拉德(Michael Gerrard)說：「這些數字讓人非常憂心。」他說，這些數據是發展中國家才會出現的，竟在美國出現令人感到詫異。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">吉拉德說：「未來幾年問題將變得更糟糕，因為氣候變遷讓氣象狀況趨於極端，災難變得頻繁，嚴重程度加劇。」</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">統計顯示，某些州受到天然災害衝擊狀況較為嚴重，佛羅里達州有88萬8000多人流離失所，路易西安納州則有36萬8000人被迫離開家園。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-weight: 700;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">財損逾10億天災 至少18起</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">2022年裡，全美受到一連串重大天然災害侵襲；國家海洋暨大氣總署(National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration， NOAA)指出，造成損失超過10億元的極端天候事件至少有18起。氣候專家多年來不斷提出警告，隨著地球溫度上升，未來將有越來越多猛烈的天然災害發生。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">吉拉德說，美國根本沒有做好準備。他說，民眾遷徙趨勢沒能反映某些地區面臨氣候變遷高度風險的現實。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">統計顯示，50多萬國人遭受天災打擊後一直未能返家，生活因此陷入痛苦，包括無家可歸以及食物問題、飲水問題、衛生不佳以及托兒問題。</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.ctspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B2.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 60%;\\\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">2022年山林野火在西部竄燒，損失慘重。圖為加州普魯馬郡的野火，燒毀民房。(美聯社)</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.ctspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B3.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 60%;\\\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\">去年7月洪水淹沒密蘇里州聖路易斯市，造成極大損失。圖為一名男子在暴雨中協助兩名汽車陷入大水，棄車逃生的人。(美聯社)</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei !important&quot;;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px;\\\">資料來源:&nbsp;</span><a href=\\\"https://udn.com/news/story/6813/6969948?from=udn-catelistnews_ch2\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(197, 224, 180); outline: 0px !important;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">https://udn.com/news/story/6813/6969948?from=udn-catelistnews_ch2</span></a></span></p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2023-02-17","clk_count":"42"}},"__N_SSG":true}